User Browser (ReactJS on S3/CloudFront)
    │
    ▼ POST /upload → API Gateway → chat_api Lambda
    │   Returns pre-signed S3 URL
    │
    ▼ PUT file directly to S3 (agentic-ai-docs-<AWS_ACCOUNT_ID>)
    │   uploads/docx/*.docx  OR  uploads/pdf/*.pdf
    │
    ▼ S3 Event → doc-upload-trigger Lambda
    │   Creates DynamoDB job record (status: QUEUED)
    │   Async invokes doc-orchestrator-agent Lambda
    │
    ▼ doc-orchestrator-agent Lambda
    ├── IF DOCX ──────────────────────────────────────────────┐
    │   Invokes Bedrock Agent (docx-summarizer-agent)         │
    │   Agent calls AWS MCP Server Lambda tools:              │
    │     → extract_docx_text (python-docx from S3)           │
    │     → invoke_bedrock_model (Claude Sonnet 4 enrichment) │
    │     → store_summary (S3 results/ + DynamoDB)            │
    │   Returns structured summary                            │
    │                                                         │
    └── IF PDF ───────────────────────────────────────────────┤
        Calls Databricks MCP Server (HTTP):                   │
          → copy_s3_to_volume (S3 → /Volumes/main/agentic_ai) │
          → process_pdf_with_agent:                           │
              PyMuPDF OCR extraction                          │
              AWS Textract fallback for image PDFs            │
              LangGraph AI Agent (Claude via Databricks FM)   │
              Persist to main.agentic_ai.document_summaries   │
        Returns summary + Unity Catalog row                   │
    │                                                         │
    ▼ DynamoDB updated (status: COMPLETED + summary)          │
    │                                                         │
    ▼ Frontend polls GET /status/{jobId}                      │
    │   Receives summary, displays in chat                    │
    │                                                         │
    ▼ User chats → POST /chat → chat_api Lambda               │
        Bedrock InvokeModelWithResponseStream (Claude Sonnet 4)
        Streams response back to browser
